{"source": "user_feedback", "parent_id": "y7g", "directive": "Port three OMZG Shader Royale (12/02/2021, 1st place) techniques into this piece. (1) KIFS spatial partitioning: apply 2 iterations of abs(position) + time-driven rotation to divide the particle field into 8 mirror-reflected sectors; each sector gets a distinct hue derived from its sign-encoded ID hash \u2014 adjacent sectors should contrast warmth/coolness. (2) Luminous boundary haze: spawn a second particle layer (large, 8-12px, alpha 0.03-0.06) that concentrates near the sector-boundary planes, creating translucent volumetric glow at the cuts between sectors. (3) RGB color channel rotation: in the vertex or fragment stage, slowly rotate the (r, b) color channels via a time-driven mat2 (period ~30s), creating a continuous iridescent hue drift across the whole scene without changing geometry.", "queued_at": "2026-05-24T20:53:19.305087+00:00"}
{"source": "checker", "priority_directive": "Crystalline lattice growth: particles snap to hexagonal grid nodes, propagate via reaction-diffusion rules, zero hand-placement \u2014 pure cellular automaton logic, cold mineral formation.", "reason": "directive_loop: 'manual' 35% of last 20", "queued_at": "2026-05-25T04:05:38.952382+00:00", "overused_directive": "manual", "count": 7}
{"source": "aesthetic_recovery", "directive": "5-column irregular Gaussian X-spread layout (asymmetric sigma_x per column: 1.4\u20132.2) \u2014 structurally distinct from uniform grids, worth preserving as a particle arrangement primitive", "origin_piece": "i99", "anti_patterns_avoided": ["sizeAttenuation-at-distance \u2014 formula `12.0 * uPixel * (8.0 / vFogDepth)` at camera-to-particle depth ~28 units renders sprites at ~3\u20134 px, not the intended 12 px; columns read as microscopic streaks instead of volumetric beams", "god-ray planes effectively invisible \u2014 plane alpha ceiling is `beam * vert * shimmer * fogF * 0.08`; at 25-unit depth fogF \u2248 0.64, yielding max alpha ~0.051 with AdditiveBlending against black \u2014 indistinguishable from background"], "queued_at": "2026-05-25T04:22:27.506975+00:00"}
